This is what I collected some time ago:

+-----------------------------+------------------------+--------------------+
|   Select  Pattern           | Firmware AA30128       | FW AA3104          |
+-------------+---------------+        AND OLDER       |   & Newer          | 
| 0           | 1             |                        |                    |
