That is the TD Systems "Viking" SCSI host adapter, Alan.  Depending on the
PAL and configuration settings it may be tape-only, disk-only, or disk and
tape.

The address responses you list sound very non-standard for MSCP or TMSCP,
though.  Probably a custom decoder PAL.

Tim.


