Assuming that you have have large programming experience
but no Java experience and needs to do a Java project,
then I would say:
   - learn Java language from *any* Java book
   - start doing some small stuff coding
   - use the downloadable JDK API doc and Java language
     for reference
   - buy some *advanced* books about the parts of Java
     you will be needing (Swing applications, EJB's, applets,
     servelts, JSP's, RMI client/server or whatever)

