jumper module. I suspect jumper module, becuase in my experimentation,
If I populate all slots with discs, I see all devices 0 - 6 on the
same bus!

Nothing is installed on the DIN behind Slot1.

Compaq Server SCSI or Adaptec SCSI are connected to the Right Angled
SCSI Connector, and the external compaq box is attached to the "pass
thru" connector. (front faceplate).  

